WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.443
When your hands are full, who answers the phone?

00:00:04.111 --> 00:00:06.419
Dialogbot takes care of your customers

00:00:07.097 --> 00:00:08.496
while you get back to work.

00:00:10.084 --> 00:00:15.275
Your AI assistant answers questions about your business, your prices and your hours.

00:00:15.978 --> 00:00:17.478
You keep your phone number.

00:00:19.170 --> 00:00:20.737
A customer wants a quote?

00:00:21.585 --> 00:00:24.738
Dialogbot finds a free slot in your calendar,

00:00:25.694 --> 00:00:28.586
books the appointment and sends a text confirmation.

00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:32.459
The same assistant helps out on your website.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.565
And with customer consent, you can run call campaigns.

00:00:37.239 --> 00:00:40.665
You approve the list, the script and the price first.

00:00:42.029 --> 00:00:44.376
You decide what it can say and do.

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.688
Just type: We're closed on Friday.

00:00:48.304 --> 00:00:50.241
Review the change, and approve.

00:00:50.887 --> 00:00:53.086
If it's unsure, it takes a message.

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:57.520
See calls, appointments and messages on your phone.

00:00:58.155 --> 00:00:59.776
Get a daily summary by email.

00:01:00.431 --> 00:01:03.302
Less busywork. More time for your customers.

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:06.456
Get started in three steps:

00:01:07.159 --> 00:01:10.407
Your business. Your calendar. Test and switch on.

00:01:11.093 --> 00:01:13.493
Want a hand? We'll help you set it up.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.072
Try Dialogbot for yourself.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:19.657
Hear how it greets your customers.

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.822
Choose your plan and get started at dialogbot.app.
